{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"The fixed check measured a violation: the full captured state repeated between ticks 20 and 30 while automatic joint exit remained pending. There was no additional message loss, no queued work, and no pending application or storage work. The control and later proposal both completed exit, which limits the finding to the missing continuation after canceled transfer rather than an inability to make progress generally.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json,subprocess\nr=json.load(open('../research.json'))\ntext='''Reviewed fixed artifact 3a14b92a84ad47ddaaf66107babcb3b9 version 1 against O-auto-exit version 1 and execution c14ff92624034255a3f506d0795b2631. Applicability comes from tracker.Config automatic transition when possible, contrasted with manual explicit joint mode, and ConfChangeV2 implicit-mode selection. The driver uses real public RawNode bootstrap, campaign, proposal, Step, Ready, ApplyConfChange and Advance; it assigns no protocol fields. The actual entry at index 5 removes node 3 using implicit joint consensus, while node 1 and node 2 remain voters. It starts transfer after applying that entry but before acknowledging its Ready. This serialized interleaving is permitted by RawNode and is also representable in Node.run while waiting for Advance. Persistence precedes outgoing delivery; every committed entry is processed before Advance, and the no-crash MemoryStorage substitution is explicit. Only TimeoutNow is lost; the actual trace contains one such drop before cancellation. Removed-peer replies are logged admission rejections, not suppressed results.\n\nThe monitor has one unique cycle_admitted prerequisite and one cycle_result for the stable independent identity (case, operation, leader, joint_index). The admission reports live AutoLeave true, three outgoing voters, leader state and transfer zero with queues empty. The result retains actual full state before/after, not an expected result. Independently reassembled Go output by test stream and parsed the complete JSON records; the two captured states compare equal. The implication repeat_cycle => \"'!joint_pending is false because both repeat_cycle and joint_pending are true. This is a closed-cycle witness for the automatic-continuation obligation, not an assertion that 30 ticks is a deadline. The test stops after fixed work independently of the property. The source history and configuration_applied records establish the same joint entry and transfer producer; no constructed peer response substitutes for it.\n\nState coverage includes all RawNode fields, all raft fields except logging sinks, reachable log/unstable and MemoryStorage bytes, membership and progress/inflight state, pending reads, deferred replies and stepsOnAdvance. At both endpoints all three logs have committed=applying=applied=5, unstable entries/snapshot empty, application size zero and stable offset 6. Leader Match for all peers is 5 with no outstanding inflights; messages and transport are empty. All nodes retain term 2, followers have electionElapsed zero, and leader has both clocks zero. Capture excludes MemoryStorage.callStats: their source uses only increment diagnostic access counters, never decision inputs. Logging sinks do not control this normal path; tracing is disabled by the build-selected nop implementation. Slice capacity and pointer addresses are allocation details on this suffix; live contents, nilness and field structure are retained, and the same node instances/closure receivers persist.\n\nThe repeating schedule ticks all three nodes once then drains all Ready and FIFO transport; sorted tracker.Visit makes broadcasts deterministic. Each follower'\"'s tick reaches elapsed 1, below its captured randomized timeout (17 or 18), and the delivered heartbeat resets it to zero. Leader heartbeats recur every tick and CheckQuorum every ten; responses keep both joint majorities active. The leader's captured randomized timeout is 14 but is not used by tickHeartbeat. No role reset occurs on this suffix, so the only random producer, resetRandomizedElectionTimeout, is not called. There are no read requests, stale replies, snapshots or storage callbacks left to alter future transitions. Ordinary heartbeat Readys contain no committed entries, so Advance schedules no appliedTo retry. abortLeaderTransfer clears the target but schedules no exit. Thus repetition can continue under complete required service without unrelated proposals or forced elections.\n\nThe no-transfer control exits at index 6. The diagnostic proposal after the measured suffix commits an ordinary entry at 6 and an automatic exit at 7. These are contrary evidence to broad unavailability, but corroborate that the joint quorum works and application progress supplies the missing trigger. Exported Status.Config.AutoLeave is false because Clone omits it; the checker deliberately reads live tracker state and the full capture, so it does not confuse that separate reporting discrepancy with loss of the live mode. No issue found in correspondence for this scoped witness; wider scheduling and safety claims are not established.'''\ns={'action':'review','artifact_id':'3a14b92a84ad47ddaaf66107babcb3b9','rationale':'Review the actual fixed state-cycle witness, legal history, source obligation and complete observation path; do not infer violation from tests_passed or finite waiting.','sources':[dict(id='s-random-timeout',file='raft.go',start_line=2043,end_line=2051,kind='code_observation'),dict(id='s-ordered-visit',file='tracker/tracker.go',start_line=184,end_line=218,kind='code_observation'),dict(id='s-heartbeat-broadcast',file='raft.go',start_line=712,end_line=737,kind='code_observation'),dict(id='s-trace-disabled',file='state_trace_nop.go',start_line=15,end_line=51,kind='code_observation')],'review_items':[{'aspect':'checker_correspondence','status':'no_issue_found','source_ids':['s-auto-contract','s-joint-interface','src-auto','s-timer','s-transfer-end','s-ready-advance','s-bootstrap-api','s-transfer-api','s-node-loop','s-ready-contract','s-node-contract','s-full-state','s-storage-state','s-storage-counters','s-random-timeout','s-ordered-visit','s-heartbeat-broadcast','s-trace-disabled','s-config-clone','s-status-copy'],'rationale':text,'counterevidence':['No-transfer control automatically exits at index 6.','A subsequent ordinary proposal allows automatic exit at index 7; available joint quorum can still commit.','A future leader can also trigger exit through application of its new-term entry.'],'limitations':['Synchronous RawNode, no crash/compaction, fixed three-node implicit removal and one lost transfer message; asynchronous storage and other histories are not executed.','The cycle witness demonstrates continuation loss under this permitted repeated schedule, not a numeric deadline or global consensus safety failure.','MemoryStorage supplies no-crash storage semantics; durability failure and application-level client outcomes are outside scope.','Status/Clone value preservation is a separate unresolved responsibility and does not establish active-state corruption.'],'report_title':'领导权转移取消后自动退出联合配置缺少续行触发','report_answer':'固定执行中，联合配置应用时发起转移导致自动退出提案被拒；转移超时取消后，正常心跳与完整 Ready 处理进入状态重复的循环，联合配置仍未退出。无转移对照和后续普通提案均可完成退出；该结果不代表共识安全破坏或整体不可用。'}],'feedback':{'ref_ids':['7e761f13c65b42ff9e000d76ca4d64ec','3a14b92a84ad47ddaaf66107babcb3b9','c14ff92624034255a3f506d0795b2631','B-apply','B-transfer'],'answered':'The fixed check measured identical full protocol/storage state over a ten-tick fully serviced suffix after transfer cancellation, with live automatic joint exit still pending. Source analysis closes random/timer/queue alternatives for that suffix. The ordinary-proposal rescue and no-transfer control delimit the consequence.','remaining':['Other callers, storage modes and transfer histories are outside this witness.','The separate Config.Clone/Status AutoLeave omission remains a sourced surface to investigate.'],'understanding':'updated','rationale':'Actual comparison and current correspondence support this continuation witness; no broader safety or availability conclusion is inferred.'}}\nfor x in s['sources']:x['end_line']=min(x['end_line'],len(open('../agent-source/'+x['file']).readlines()))\njson.dump(s,open('submission.json','w'),indent=2);print(subprocess.run(r['validation']['command']+['submission.json'],capture_output=True,text=True).stdout)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
